source_location=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-debian-rurema/3717a77b-67d6-4a40-b15e-a41ca141ab34/scratchpad/frozen.wG7wMH/src/refm/api/src/rexml/document.rd

--- stand_alone? -> String
XML 宣言の standalone の値を文字列で返します。

=== 例
  require 'rexml/document'
  doc = REXML::Document.new(<<EOS)
  <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
  <e />
  EOS
  doc.stand_alone? # => "yes"

